{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47227","headline":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进士一诗共六首 二 · 吴越僧","name":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进士一诗共六首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙源佛窟有天台，今古嘉名遍九垓。\n石磴嵌空神匠出，瀑泉雄壮雨声来。\n景强偏感高僧上，地胜能令远思开。\n一等翘诚依此处，自然灵贶作梯媒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴越僧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47227.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47227","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}